OL,3,GNEWSATwo swans killed in acts of
OL,4,A'deliberate cruelty'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn RSPCA inspector described suspected
OL,7,Fcatapult attacks that killed two swans
OL,8,Fas "one of the worst types of
OL,9,Fdeliberate cruelty" he had seen in
OL,10,Frecent times.
OL,12,FOn 8 October, an injured swan was
OL,13,Frescued from a drainage ditch in the
OL,14,FKing's Avenue area of King's Lynn,
OL,15,FNorfolk, after concerns were raised by
OL,16,Fthe public.
OL,18,FA ball bearing had fractured its skull,
OL,19,Fand it was put to sleep at East Winch
OL,20,FWildlife Centre to prevent further
OL,21,Fsuffering.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
