OL,3,GNEWSATwo swans killed in acts of
OL,4,A'deliberate cruelty'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the same location, another swan was
OL,7,Ffound dead with a ball bearing inside
OL,8,Fit. The RSPCA has appealed for
OL,9,Finformation to track those responsible.
